# Phase transition (Biconditional + Yesterday)
#
# "scanning is true now if and only if idle was true at the previous step"
#
# Tests exact phase sequencing across multiple drones. In a single-drone
# system this would hold (scanning always follows idle). In a multi-drone
# system, the global state is the union of all drones' props, so scanning
# from Drone1 and idle from Drone2 can coexist independently of the
# previous step's state.
scanning <-> @idle
